WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:01.570
What's up everybody!

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:02.570
We are Pongfinity

00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:04.240
And today we are here in Copenhagen

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.390
With the one and only -

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:06.380
Michael Maze.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:08.260
How are you Michael?

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:09.260
I'm great!

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:10.600
I'm feeling good,

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.190
I'm at the Bröndy football stadium

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:13.520
It is my favorite club

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:14.650
So I feel perfect!

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:16.340
Great!

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:20.759
We are going to try out Butterfly's brand-new
Amicus Prime table tennis robot.

00:00:20.759 --> 00:00:23.039
We are going to do some challenges between
us

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.360
Let's see how it goes!

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.460
Let's start with an accuracy battle.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:33.680
The one who uses less shots and knocks down
all the cups, wins!

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:34.720
I'll go first.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.320
That was pure luck.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:07.420
Let's replace the cups with real table tennis
balls

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:09.200
to see who is more precise.

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:11.700
Sounds good to me - let's go!

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:39.400
I guess we can say that the last challenge
was pretty even.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.140
Now - let's do the speed battle.

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:43.460
We will set the robot on max speed

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.580
And random distribution.

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:02.100
Next, we are going to go around the net.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.080
Five forehand and five backhand!

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:05.220
Let's go!

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:52.900
Now, let's have a side spin battle.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.860
Let's see how well we can handle the spin
of the robot

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:58.320
to knock down the pyramid.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:02.480
Next, let's try the maximum underspin and
topspin of the robot.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.980
I'm gonna beat you easily!

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:00.400
Alright, that's a wrap then for today!

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:02.580
Thank you very much Michael for having us
here!

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:03.960
Yeah, thank you.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.400
It was my pleasure having you here

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.930
It was very very nice!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.620
And a huge thanks to Butterfly

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:11.720
for making this video possible.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:14.139
If you want to buy your own Butterfly robot

00:06:14.139 --> 00:06:16.720
Remember to use the "Pongfinity" promotion
code

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:18.970
And get 72 table tennis balls for free.

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:20.220
Until next time!

